sequenceDiagram
    actor Developer
    participant UI as Portal/API/CLI
    participant S as Platform service
    participant P as Policy engine
    participant B as Bundle builder
    participant G as External GitHub workflow
    Developer->>UI: Submit request + idempotency key
    UI->>S: Validate and normalize
    S->>P: Evaluate common and provider policy
    alt denied
        P-->>S: Friendly violations
        S-->>UI: Stable denied record
    else accepted
        P-->>S: Accepted decision
        S->>B: Build canonical proposal bundle
        B-->>S: Proposal ID, content hash, seven artifacts
        S-->>UI: ready_for_review proposal
        UI-->>Developer: Evidence and optional CLI bundle
        Developer-->>G: Separately publish/review exact inputs
        Note over S,G: GitHub approval never mutates local proposal state
    end
